      <activity id="4675ab88-d86d-5cf7-8a2b-8a61bec9874a" activityNameId="1d441069-6976-59d1-ad17-48a6b644367d" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Refinery gas, burned in flare</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Refinery gas, burned in flare
Description of the direct emissions due to the combustion of refinery gas in refinery flares not including the infrastructure of the flare.;
UUID: 9ee15e39-2e49-343f-97c9-80a4764a0422
Combustion emissions.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average technology in use.
Time period: New European data from single plants for regulated emissions like CO2, NOx, SOx etc. have been provided in the literature. They have been compared and discussed with older literature data.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature survey and plant data. 
Extrapolations: Some emissions are estimated with data from flares used in natural gas production.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9ee15e39-2e49-343f-97c9-80a4764a0422.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
